      <description><![CDATA[
        <p>First release with auto-update support &mdash; installs from this point forward receive subsequent updates via Sparkle.</p>
        <h3>Added</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Auto-update via Sparkle 2.x</strong>. Daily background checks against this appcast, on-demand &ldquo;Check for Updates&hellip;&rdquo; menu item, EdDSA-verified update integrity.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
